# TrialGuard environment variables
#
# TrialGuard currently needs NO environment variables.
# It uses no API keys, passwords, databases or external services, so you do not
# need to create a .env file to run it.
#
# If a future version needs settings, list them here with dummy values, copy this
# file to .env and fill in real values locally.
# NEVER commit the .env file — it is in .gitignore.
